### SkyLink API examples (VS Code REST Client format)
@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Customer register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Customer Name","email":"customer@example.com","password":"replace-me-123"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer@example.com","password":"replace-me-123"}

### Public tracking (returns no data until a real shipment is created in MongoDB)
GET {{base}}/public/track?numbers=YOUR-TRACKING-ID

### Public schedules
GET {{base}}/public/schedules?page=1&limit=10

### Published news
GET {{base}}/public/news?page=1&limit=10

### Admin list shipments – replace JWT
GET {{base}}/admin/shipments?page=1&limit=10&search=&status=BOOKED
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_JWT>
